# The ending live_deliciously (data/endings/live_deliciously.json): the narration the ending screen plays before its slides. The Vagrant tells it
# afterwards: second person, present tense, one or two sentences a line, no game words. First draft by Claude; Gemini edits it.

~ start
Narrator: Every one of you has said yes to the black goat already, and when he asks one more time, kneeling is the easiest thing in the world.
Narrator: Three red eyes look down on you with something like fondness, and the Wytchwood fills with music.
Narrator: You get everything he promised, and you keep on getting it, long after you've stopped wanting any of it.
